====== Buffalo WLI-TX4-G54HP ======

{{section>meta:infobox:432_warning#infobox_for_dataentries&noheader&nofooter&noeditbutton}}

Backfire openwrt-brcm-2.4-squashfs.trx can be flashed using TFTP. TFTP address during boot is 192.168.11.1
Device only has 4 ports with the WAN port missing/unpopulated on the board. One of the LAN ports may be assigned as WAN using the Switch/VLAN configuration.
